    "body": "The CSP spec includes a link to https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/issues/938 which explains the missing source in the hook. However, the current state only includes the parameter strings as a list with the body string, rather than the compiled source string which CSP currently requires.\r\n\r\nHowever, if https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/3294 is accepted then the ECMA definition will change again and pass through the compiled string (along with certain other parameters that will be needed).",
